e_name": "Untitled-3.png", "id": "1457878311765107", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75647714_1457878321765106_873955209399552846_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mPG94kWRQgwQ7kNvwHv8Alg&_nc_oc=AdpEDUWxYTalb_HW8H3syv0F0IAWAA-Zr80sIZg8QvdldnjaZwtcrk_awvHhXhZZFtA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQb093iR_U6HkSvwPL6OHR5FGc8rOxRVNADJZwdsee1Qg&oe=6AFF3706"}, {"file_name": "Untitled-2.png", "id": "853176473329833", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75196224_853176476663166_2779387245026015972_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QP2sb7j66BQQ7kNvwFgQedP&_nc_oc=AdqOVtYP819BdPm9sqbq9SkTmzm1fIvU1NzP3xAWyP2QgRxZuxwZtRhklnwJysPsAvg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRcmScIwdO2QwUbsiqjWBlQeUQCE0BUiMD3BKh2tnRItg&oe=6AFF1C83"}, {"file_name": "Untitled-6.png", "id": "838588491102212", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031309_838588494435545_3221430962329902390_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AlnTv71wuq0Q7kNvwERABFe&_nc_oc=AdqHbNf0sK89aafUKomMFLs8FZgmaxvKylurfOMIF2l76mS8lV8YDMp3EVnD9EhnnwY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSttGttXIeKjBthNybwg0ksTvyyohLYu852t781_gWejg&oe=6AFF1E52"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "WIZARD.S.LEGACY.COVER.24.BIT (1).png", "id": "794564832812199", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65228545_794564836145532_348548685399172447_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F2INGEFIA3AQ7kNvwG6PIqE&_nc_oc=AdrLv29pycQsVXJJNkKYnBWUiuYlNZo2YwQKLBKS-9zZ-lTCKDTJiNNc1yOKsnAIrxY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTUR6T6iH54YprSujjc_6UU3DPMgdchPwze7PSkhyr5_g&oe=6AFF0EE2"}, "display_name": "Wizard's Legacy", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Wizard\u2019s Legacy blends VR immersion with roguelite replayability, offering action, adventure, and fantasy. Play as a powerful wizard, explore dynamic dungeons, face formidable foes, and uncover ancient secrets. Become the wizard you were meant to be.\n\n{3648923568693208}\nA desperate father, bound by a dark pact, transforms into a wizard trapped within a cursed labyrinth. Each victory grants power, but death returns him to the start. Explore the labyrinth's ever-changing depths, where every battle unveils its grim history. Can you master magic, overcome enemies, and save your child?\n\n{362183290313011}\n\n{459743683357113}\nDive deeper, shaping the world with every decision. Explore branching paths, unearth secrets, and face escalating challenges. Collect potions and power-ups scattered throughout to enhance your magic and forge your destiny as a powerful wizard.\n\n{828863472676196}\nUnleash your inner wizard! Draw symbols to control fireballs, ice walls, and lightning. Feel the power surge as you master arcane combat.\n\n{1407283433268429}\n\n{1453454962100883}\nChoose from a variety of playable characters, each with unique spells and abilities. Experiment with different playstyles \u2013 fiery mage, cunning illusionist, or something else entirely?\n\n{1136617717392676}\nThe labyrinth teems with cunning foes, each demanding a unique strategy. Test your skills against a diverse array of enemies, adapting tactics to exploit weaknesses and emerge victorious.\n\n{788110426812574}\n\n{1584321828806767}\nImmerse yourself in stunning visuals. Explore dynamic dungeons, lush forests, and ominous landscapes, each meticulously detailed for an unforgettable VR experience.\n\n\n{1415112652482029}\n\n", "short_description": "Wizard\u2019s Legacy blends VR immersion with roguelite replayability, offering action, adventure, and fantasy. Play as a powerful wizard, explore dynamic dungeons, face formidable foes, and uncover ancient secrets. Become the wizard you were meant to be."}]